Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 21:32:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 16/29] patch: simple_scratchpad - 3 scratchpad slots

Conflicts: kept tags[] over TAGCOUNT, kept our 12 setlayout binds and grafted
the scratchpad binds, and merged destroynotify so BOTH btrtile's tree cleanup
and the scratchpad slot cleanup run.
---
 config.def.h        |  7 ++++
 dwl.c               | 43 +++++++++++++++++++++--
 simple_scratchpad.c | 85 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 133 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 simple_scratchpad.c

diff --git a/config.def.h b/config.def.h
index be1ae29..08c1bf4 100644
